# {{name}}

A [Typeway](https://github.com/k1eu/typeway) app: Elysia `/api` + TanStack Start pages, one process.

## Commands

```sh
bun install
bun run dev          # http://localhost:3000 — PORT / HMR_PORT respected
bun test             # unit (next to source) + integration (tests/)
bun run build
bun run start        # bun dist/app — not executable on its own
typeway routes --json
```

`GET /api/hello` is the smoke probe. `GET /` is TanStack SSR.

## Layout

See `AGENTS.md`. Domain data goes through typed Elysia routes; pages call them with Eden (`src/lib/api.ts`). Do not rename `src/server.ts`.
